### Commande payée -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-42",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "CLAVIER", "qty": 2 }
  ]
}

### Commande refusée (598 € > 500 €) -> 402 Payment Required
POST http://localhost:3001/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-42",
  "items": [
    { "sku": "ECRAN", "qty": 2 }
  ]
}

### Relire la commande refusée -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:3001/orders/CMD-0002